  another job      sudo vg submit gen-0.genome gen-0.key
  your own model   seal its genome with acpctl (docs/operator/09_first_deployment.md §4) into /var/lib/vaultgenome/genomes, then vg submit
  the console      aws ec2 get-console-output --region us-east-2 --instance-id i-05d175ac2d11bf9f0 --latest --output text
  a stop/start     moves the instance to another host and gives it a new public address (aws ec2 describe-instances --instance-ids i-05d175ac2d11bf9f0); the services and the sealed key files come back on their own
